TCH on all 10 tickers; robustness verdicts re-derived from the artifact reproduce for all assets), found the lookback=5 edge is lookback-robust for 6/10 assets and 0/10 lookback-sensitive, and admitted momentum to the evidence base as candidate positive evidence.
